LOK: Impress checks a deck before a show

.uno:SlideCheck lists, for every slide and master, the font families
its text asks for, its linked files (pictures, OLE) and whether each is
missing, and the objects the kernel cannot show (unreadable pictures,
OLE objects with no data, pictures that do not decode). A missing
linked picture is listed once.

